# Spring Framework XsltView RCE: the fix exists only in Spring Framework 7 / Spring Boot 4, not in the 6.2.x line used by
# Spring Boot 3.x (ADR-009). The template does not use XsltView. Revisit when moving to Spring Boot 4.
CVE-2026-47884
